# Star UI for Kilo Code — License & Usage Notice

Star UI for Kilo Code is a fork of [Star-Office-UI](https://github.com/ringhyacinth/Star-Office-UI)
by Ring Hyacinth & Simon Lee, adapted into a VS Code extension for Kilo Code.
It contains code under the MIT License and third-party art assets under their own terms.

