## 2. Art assets (NOT MIT — non-commercial only)

The art assets in `media/assets/` (character sprites, backgrounds, furniture, posters, plants,
coffee machine, server room, animations, memo background) come from Star-Office-UI and are
**not** covered by the MIT License. Their authors license them for **non-commercial learning,
demonstration and idea sharing only**.

- You may not use these art assets for commercial purposes.
- If you want to use this project commercially, you must replace all art assets with your own work.
- This extension is free and non-commercial; the assets are redistributed with attribution under
  those terms. Rights holders can open an issue to request changes or removal.

Guest character animations (`guest_anim_*.webp`) use LimeZu's free assets:
*Animated Mini Characters 2 (Platformer) [FREE]* — https://limezu.itch.io/animated-mini-characters-2-platform-free.
Please keep this attribution and follow the original author's license terms when redistributing.

